<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Q:<sp/>**_&quot;I<sp/>don&apos;t<sp/>like<sp/>the<sp/>fact<sp/>that<sp/>it<sp/>uses<sp/>GLFW<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>window...&quot;_**</highlight></codeline>
