<codeline><highlight class="normal">A:<sp/>`¯\_(ツ)_/¯`<sp/>Well<sp/>it&apos;s<sp/>better<sp/>than<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>native<sp/>windowing<sp/>framework,<sp/>at<sp/>least<sp/>it<sp/>is<sp/>portable,<sp/>at<sp/>least<sp/>if<sp/>something<sp/>is<sp/>wrong<sp/>with<sp/>it<sp/>students<sp/>can<sp/>actually<sp/>fix<sp/>it<sp/>by<sp/>making<sp/>a<sp/>PR<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>respective<sp/>repository.<sp/>Additionally<sp/>GLFW<sp/>is<sp/>pretty<sp/>standard<sp/>for<sp/>things<sp/>like<sp/>this,<sp/>simply<sp/>checkout<sp/>any<sp/>graphics<sp/>demo<sp/>and<sp/>somewhere<sp/>you<sp/>will<sp/>end<sp/>up<sp/>with<sp/>GLFW<sp/>under<sp/>the<sp/>hood<sp/>quite<sp/>often.</highlight></codeline>
